WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.590
Who may see what? Seven models answer it, each from a

00:00:03.590 --> 00:00:07.180
different angle. Qadamar combines them in one decision.

00:00:08.280 --> 00:00:14.490
Role-based access: rights follow the job. An analyst role, a finance

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:20.700
role. Simple, but a role alone knows nothing about the record.

00:00:21.800 --> 00:00:25.990
Attribute-based access: rules read the person, the record and its content.

00:00:25.990 --> 00:00:30.180
A financial amount is masked for anyone without the finance role.

00:00:31.280 --> 00:00:37.020
Context-based access: same person, different situation. Off the trusted network, without

00:00:37.020 --> 00:00:42.760
recent M F A, or outside the grant window, access narrows.

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:48.500
A missing signal fails closed.

00:00:49.600 --> 00:00:53.140
Relations give a reason to know: the clinician who treats a

00:00:53.140 --> 00:00:56.680
patient. They form a graph, and every answer carries its path.

00:00:56.680 --> 00:01:00.220
A relation never lifts a clearance.

00:01:01.320 --> 00:01:05.670
Bell La Padula, nineteen seventy-three, for confidentiality: no read up, no

00:01:05.670 --> 00:01:10.020
write down. Secrets never flow to a lower level.

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:16.350
Biba, nineteen seventy-seven, mirrors it for integrity: no write up. Less

00:01:16.350 --> 00:01:21.580
trusted data cannot corrupt more trusted data.

00:01:22.680 --> 00:01:27.090
Clark Wilson, nineteen eighty-seven, for business integrity: sensitive changes run only

00:01:27.090 --> 00:01:31.500
through certified commands, with separation of duty and a single-use token.

00:01:32.600 --> 00:01:37.005
Every request runs them in one fixed order: roles, the mandatory

00:01:37.005 --> 00:01:41.410
models, need-to-know, attributes, context, then certified commands and separation of duty.

00:01:41.410 --> 00:01:45.815
No tenant rule can reorder them or switch them off. One

00:01:45.815 --> 00:01:50.220
deny stops the request.

00:01:51.320 --> 00:01:54.650
These are the models classified defence systems were built on. Qadamar

00:01:54.650 --> 00:01:57.980
brings them together in one self-hosted engine.
